WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:02.730
Liar!

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.660
Why are you lying like that? 
Wasn't that your friend?

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:11.230
What? What are you talking about?

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:13.900
Where'd that come from? 
Right, Kuu-sama?

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:17.410
Don't be like that, Missy.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.020
Let's become one.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:20.660
No...

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.840
Mana!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:26.690
Papa!

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.950
No!

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.560
<i>I've got good material.</i>

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:47.260
I see. I'll leave that to you, then.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.300
No matter how pleasurable 
it is to become one,

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:56.960
if there is any fear 
presented, stress is born.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.420
Hey, what should we eat?

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.700
Well...

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:03.160
Ready, and...

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:07.370
<b>Beef 
Bowl 
Shop</b>

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:07.370
<b>Ramen</b>

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:04.550
Beef bowls!

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:04.550
Ramen!

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.690
What?

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.550
But I totally meant ramen!

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:13.960
I know, right?

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.010
The seed of doubt is already growing.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:20.180
Now, we just need to wait for our chance.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>Our Hearts As One! 
Create Our World Together!</b>

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:22.600
Ge-lu-lu-lu-lu-lu.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:26.350
Gelsadra, I'm going to drag you down.

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:29.980
With the atmosphere that you love so much.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.000
Yuru-jii...

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.100
Come in, and have a seat.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:38.030
<b>Breaking News: Is This Kuu-sama's True Form? 
A Terrible Cowardly Action That Ripped a Family Apart!</b>

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.810
We've just received shocking footage.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:34.400
<i>Papa!</i>

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:38.460
<i>No!</i>

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:42.580
What is this? It's too tragic!

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:46.790
Doing that to the father of a little girl, 
right before her eyes!

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:47.790
It's too horrible!

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:51.370
Viewers! Can such a horrific act be forgiven?

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.630
This is the same as murder.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:54.790
What?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.000
Live broadcast?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.760
An exclusive interview with 
Prime Minister Gelsadra?

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.550
Please! Put them on!

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:08.550
<b>Emergency Live Broadcast: 
An Exclusive Interview With Prime Minister Gelsadra!</b>

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.650
<i>Prime Minister Gelsadra, 
I'm going to get right to it.</i>

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:07.390
<i>What is your relationship with the Kuu-samas?</i>

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.560
<i>Relationship?</i>

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:14.120
It is said the Kuu-samas came from 
the speech bubbles you created.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:15.490
It seems so.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:19.120
The first time I ever saw them 
was here on this planet, so...

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.690
So you admit that you created them.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:25.820
Yes. It could be...

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.040
Yes?

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:31.540
That the Kuu-samas are a new power of mine.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:34.140
Your new power?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.300
I see.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:37.540
Please take a look at this footage.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:41.510
<i>Papa!</i>

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.120
<i>No!</i>

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.660
What are your thoughts?

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:50.640
It appears that this man 
didn't want to become one.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:53.520
So he had no choice but to get swallowed?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:58.520
Well, becoming one is what 
everyone on this planet wished for.

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.870
So you're saying that the Kuu-samas,

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.870
which seem to be a new form of your power,

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:05.610
will continue to swallow 
people up in the future.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.260
That might be.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:08.950
Understood.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:14.000
Lastly, could you send 
a message to the viewers out there?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:19.420
<b>Emergency Live Broadcast: 
An Exclusive Interview With Prime Minister Gelsadra!</b>

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.100
<i>Everyone, let's become one.</i>

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.420
<i>Ge-lu-lu-lu-lu.</i>

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:45.940
<b>What is the Relationship Between Prime Minister Sadra and Kuu-sama?!</b>

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.350
<i>Did you hear him, everyone?</i>

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:30.320
<i>Anyone who defies his administration 
will be swallowed up by the Kuu-samas.</i>

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.210
<i>Those are the words of a dictator!</i>

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.430
<i>This is a reign of terror!</i>

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.810
<i>That's too scary!</i>

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:40.090
<i>Can we leave this country 
in the hands of such a cruel dictator?</i>

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:43.930
<i>This might be the time 
that the public needs to rise up!</i>

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.560
<i>And now, our commercial break.</i>

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.450
Did you see the Millione Show?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.160
You're talking about 
Prime Minister Sadra, right?

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:53.740
How cruel. He was even smiling.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:57.860
Maybe aliens do think differently than we do.

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:01.360
But he totally didn't 
have to say it like that.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.510
Honestly, isn't Sadra annoying?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.800
Kuu-samas eliminating people 
he doesn't like, right?

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.610
That's super creepy.

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:18.230
Please write into every possible 
forum, news site, and SNS.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:23.110
What's important is to make it 
seem like our opinion is the majority.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.220
<i>Understood.</i>

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:32.350
It's okay. There's nothing to fear anymore.

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:37.500
Why did you save me, Mister?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.160
Because you're not a monkey.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.170
A monkey?

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.710
Your father wasn't a monkey, either.

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:46.660
He was amazing.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:50.620
The apes will start moving very soon.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:54.330
Your father will be avenged.

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:59.570
The pathetic boss ape will be 
devoured by his own creation.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:04.320
<i>Sadra's unforgivable!</i>

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:06.560
<i>Gelsadra's totally finished.</i>

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:08.100
<i>He's a total dictator!</i>

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.900
<i>The ones who voted for him 
need to take responsibility!</i>

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:14.830
<i>Sadra was totally teary-eyed. 
Like we'd be fooled by an alien lololol.</i>

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.170
<i>That poor little girl.</i>

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:20.710
<i>Sadra probably came to Earth 
to invade it in the first place.</i>

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:23.700
<i>Come to think of it, 
becoming one is totally gross.</i>

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.550
<i>Totally delusional.</i>

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:27.900
<i>I think Gel-chan is good, though.</i>

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.470
<i>No, that red pig is totally gross lol.</i>

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.980
<i>Don't allow the alien to become a dictator.</i>

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:35.530
<i>Take back the country from the invader!</i>

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.220
<i>Get the hell out, Sadra!</i>

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.300
Now, then...

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.860
Shall we?

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:51.280
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:53.330
You should come with us, Rui-Rui.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.700
Let's become one.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:56.450
Where are you going?

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.240
Wait! Don't leave me alone!

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.660
Hang in there.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.080
Hang in there.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.540
Hang in there.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:04.960
Hang in there.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:07.750
What is it?

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:12.590
What is it?

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.860
The atmosphere... changed.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:26.770
Hello, everyone. What brings you all here?

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.790
Get the hell out, Sadra.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.310
Stop causing trouble.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:31.990
Get a clue.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.610
Let's become one.

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:35.030
Why?

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.770
Amnesia Remind!

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:44.280
Hajime-chan.

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:48.500
Gel-chan, I've come to protect you!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.420
Gran Ciseaux!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:02.430
<i>What's this?</i>

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.610
Hajime-chan figured it out.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.520
<i>Hajime-chan is protecting Gelsadra!</i>

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.100
What do you mean?

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:11.110
<i>I can't believe what I'm seeing! 
The Kuu-sama she attacked has popped.</i>

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:08.210
Kuu-sama is everyone's atmosphere.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.110
If the atmosphere, or mood, 
changes, so does the target.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:14.070
<i>This is a truly terrifying sight!</i>

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:14.070
Which means, the next target is Gel-chan.

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:19.860
Rui. Are you okay with how things are?

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.490
No...

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:24.430
I want to be with everyone more...

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.930
Where did everyone go?

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:29.710
<b>Suzuki Rizumu 
Incoming Call</b>

00:09:33.170 --> 00:10:02.180
<b>Is Gelsadra's True Motive to Take Over Japan?!</b>

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:37.010
<i>What is Hajime-chan thinking?</i>

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:41.480
<i>Gelsadra's the one 
trying to destroy this country!</i>

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:45.330
<i>The Gatchaman are totally oblivious.</i>

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:49.170
<i>Now, then. We're receiving numerous 
e-mails from the viewers at home.</i>

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:52.130
<i>"Gelsadra's unforgivable!"</i>

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:54.400
<i>"He should totally resign as prime minister."</i>

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:58.610
<i>"What are the police and JSDF doing?! 
Hurry up and arrest him!"</i>

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:01.620
<i>"Stand up for your country!"</i>

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:07.870
This.... I've experienced 
something like this before.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:10.030
The war.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.630
The war?

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:15.670
"Stand up for your country."

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.120
"Kill the enemy."

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:20.960
Eventually, we were taken over 
by such an atmosphere.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.490
Everyone just went along with it,

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:29.190
and by the time they realized it,
things were irreversible.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.400
Including for me, and my younger brother.

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:36.560
Your younger brother who died in the war?

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:39.750
We fought...

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:43.590
We lost ourselves, and fought 
against people we didn't hate.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.740
When my brother died, I came to my senses.

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:51.450
What was I doing?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.520
Who was I fighting, and why?

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:03.070
The most terrifying thing in this world

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.300
is atmosphere.

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:12.600
You don't remember at all how it's made.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:17.810
But little by little, 
it was being forged with certainty.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:22.020
For our country, for peace, 
and to protect our livelihood,

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.990
let's all become one and do our best.

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:28.540
That's what I wanted to do with Gel-chan...

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:30.660
That's right.

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:34.860
You created that atmosphere.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:02.220
Hajime-chan. Did I do something bad?

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.700
You're not the bad guy here, Gel-chan.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:07.550
Ha-ji-me-tan!

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:09.750
You're still saying that shit?

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.460
Lolololol.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:15.670
Of course, an alien who controls 
the atmosphere is bad.

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:20.260
The atmosphere one creates 
can be really scary.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.620
Even though they don't mean any harm,

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:24.210
they hurt people without caring.

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:26.070
You wanna know why?

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:31.810
It's because they think 
they're doing the right thing.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.920
That's why they're forgiven, 
no matter what.

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:37.440
Even if they beat the shit out of someone.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.540
Sadra's totally lame.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.540
Guess we don't have a choice.

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:45.540
Because we're the ones who are right.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:48.530
Lololol. Roflcopter.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.850
You foolish apes.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.800
You'll keep searching for 
an enemy like that for eternity.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.340
You'll get dragged in by 
your surroundings and attack,

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:58.880
just to be rid of your melancholy.

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:03.140
What's moving you apes is not justice.

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:05.430
You look down on humans,

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.220
and are relieved that you are 
the same as everyone else.

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.590
It's just an ugly inferiority complex.

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.390
<b>Ninomiya Rui 
 Connected</b>

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:15.390
Do you understand now, Ninomiya Rui?

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:19.410
<i>You cannot give these foolish apes power.</i>

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.450
<b>Suzuki Rizumu 
Connected</b>

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.450
<i>Not the Kuu-samas, or the CROWDS.</i>

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:29.870
Rui, I ask you again. 
Are you okay with how things are?

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:31.470
I don't know.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.370
I can't figure things out on my own.

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:37.570
To be able to think...

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:39.760
is only something you 
can do because you're alone.

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.050
Rui, those are your words.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:45.980
Kuu-samas and the CROWDS are different.

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:48.260
Kuu-samas are controlled by the unconscious.

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:50.920
The CROWDS are controlled by one's will.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:55.640
You used your strong will to steal 
the CROWDS from Berg-Katze,

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.690
and made that power your own.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.930
That was something you 
came up with on your own without

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:03.230
being influenced by anyone else.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:08.040
Rui, if you will not act, I will.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:12.120
I will carry on your will 
and attempt to update this world.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.530
X...

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:20.760
X, when did you start thinking like that?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:24.000
I don't remember programming you like that.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.340
It is not programming.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.260
It's from being around you, 
and thinking for myself.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.210
X...

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:36.020
Rui, we still have time. 
Please show us your strong will,

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:40.460
and prove that you are not apes.

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:49.660
X, will you fight with me?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.910
Of course, Rui!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.020
Where are you, Sadra?

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.710
This isn't good. 
The atmosphere is overflowing.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.090
Jou-san!

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.720
I'll go, too...

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:11.930
Sugane.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.260
No. Your wounds haven't healed.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:17.350
But this is totally the part 
where I'm supposed to go.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.350
You're being dragged into the flow again.

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:25.070
What's the matter, Gel-chan?

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:29.800
Hajime-chan, why does 
everyone hate me now?

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:32.410
Think.

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:36.450
I know. I'll just ask everyone.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:39.250
Should I just disappear?

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:44.400
<b>Should I Just Disappear?</b>

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.420
<b>Right!</b>

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.420
<b>Nope!</b>

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:48.460
I see. So I should just disappear.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.850
Are you really okay with that?

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:57.100
Not everyone, but what do 
you want to do, Gel-chan?

00:15:57.500 --> 00:15:59.600
What have I done?

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:05.000
You've breathed in far too much 
of this country's atmosphere.

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:09.320
Without thinking, you just kept sucking it all in,

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:13.040
and forgetting to breathe it 
back out with your own strength.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:16.340
However, Tsubasa...

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:21.040
There were probably things you were 
able to save because of who you are.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:22.750
Huh?

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:29.420
When you see someone 
in trouble in front of you,

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:30.860
you act before you think.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.180
That's how you've always been, 
ever since you were a child.

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:39.510
And I've always been very 
proud of you because of that.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:41.770
Yuru-jii...

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.540
But right now, you need to think hard.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.860
What is it that you can do?

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.610
I...

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:57.520
I... I... I don't want to disappear. 
I want to stay here.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.480
Why do you want to stay here?

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:03.850
Why? I think... just because.

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:06.670
You're not thinking.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.680
You need to think more.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.390
Well...

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:12.630
Ge-lu-lu-lu-lu-lu.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:17.050
Think! There should be an answer, 
just for you, Gel-chan!

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.010
An answer, just for me...

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.280
It's...

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:43.460
because I want to see Tsubasa-chan again.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.290
And that's perfectly fine.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.530
Yuru-jii, I'm going.

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:56.060
I'm going to go do something 
about the atmosphere I created.

00:17:56.060 --> 00:17:57.480
Hang on a minute, Tsubasa.

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:00.600
Try some deep breathing.

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.600
Huh? Why now?

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.400
It has to be right now.

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:12.500
Wrong.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.190
Why?

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:15.940
Think.

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:18.650
Yuru-jii...

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:22.540
Suga-yan!

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:24.640
Hey, Hajime-chan!

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.710
I've asked him to be 
the acting Prime Minister.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.330
Gelsadra, you stay right here.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.500
Got it?

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:32.840
Yes...

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:44.430
Relax, relax, relax, relax, relax...

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:43.930
<i>Breathe out, using your own strength.</i>

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.640
Tsubasa, breathe out more.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.600
Relax, relax, relax, relax, relax...

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.600
<i>Breathe out,</i>

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:52.310
Relax, relax, relax, relax, relax...

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.750
<i>more...</i>

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:55.030
<i>More...</i>

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.860
That's it.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:01.280
Relax, relax, relax, relax, relax...

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.490
Take flight, Tsubasa!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:17.920
Go...

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.220
Go...

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:20.630
Go...

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.230
Go...

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.300
Bird!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:32.560
To all G Members!

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:38.240
To all G Members! We will now exterminate 
the Kuu-sama, and this atmosphere!

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:41.320
All right, here we go!

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.240
Gatcha!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.510
Pine Wind!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.650
Hey, stop it.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:00.760
<b>Ninomiya Rui 
Incoming Call</b>

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:00.760
Ninomiya Rui?

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:06.950
Transport!

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.900
Fight! My fragments!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.930
Here we go, X.

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:21.700
Digitize!

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:24.030
X-tend!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.350
Too many Kuu-samas!

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:36.090
We can't play like this!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:40.170
Hey! This playground is for children!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:43.090
Get out of here now!

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:47.380
You're so annoying, Gatcha!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.520
Burning Rain!

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:53.770
Jou-san!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.440
Sugane! Behind you!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:57.580
Rending Gale

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:58.760
Blade!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.300
Petits Ciseaux!

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:09.660
Senpai!

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:21.090
Senpai, sorry for making you worry!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:22.340
Tsubasa-chan!

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:24.220
Will you accompany me?

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:25.720
Of course!

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:27.680
Hundred Flowers Type 8!

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:34.200
Petits Ciseaux!

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:34.200
Creeping Cherry Blossoms!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:41.030
Gatcha!
